<title>LEBANON: Lebanon has $36.7 mln BoP surplus in September.</title>
<headline>Lebanon has $36.7 mln BoP surplus in September.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon had a $36.7 million balance of payments surplus in September, $68.4 million down on August and below the September 1995 surplus of $46.7 million, the Bank of Lebanon said in its latest monthly bulletin on Monday.</p>
<p>    BALANCE OF PAYMENTS	Sept 96	 Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p>    Monthly			 36.7	   105.1	  46.7</p>
<p>    Year to date		 322.3	   285.6	-170.2</p>
<p>Annual results</p>
<p>    1995	 256</p>
<p>    1994     1,130.5</p>
<p>    1993     1,169.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 861723</p>
